Hi Chester,

For this sort of question, I like to go straight to the code.

You can find the code on github, and the specific file you want is here: https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/blob/5b1cb152d95a2293aaa84b89357c123a12d63282/R/lav_fit_measures.R

Here's the part where cfi is calculated:

if("cfi" %in% fit.measures) {
t1 <- max( c(X2 - df, 0) )
t2 <- max( c(X2 - df, X2.null - df.null, 0) )
if(t1 == 0 && t2 == 0) {
indices["cfi"] <- 1
} else {
indices["cfi"] <- 1 - t1/t2
}

