From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Fri, 18 Nov 2016 10:33:42 +0000
Subject: Re: Convergence problems in lavaan - measurement invariance categorical Data
Message-ID: <V3YqttCkP1M.5ruq7-myAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <V3YqttCkP1M.vFl0NN8dAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <V3YqttCkP1M.vFl0NN8dAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
